[0.000, "o", "• \u001b[1mInteractive breakdown\u001b[m: Reply \"interactive breakdown\" for a guided, item-by-item walkthrough in chat with detailed\r\n  explanations for each proposed edit or contested finding before making decisions.\r\n  • \u001b[1mCustom instruction / Wildcard request\u001b[m: Reply with any custom instruction, question, or out-of-band request.\r\n\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m> interactive\u001b[m\r\n\n\u001b[37m▸ Thought for 15s\u001b[m\r\n\n  \u001b[1m### Breakdown Item 1 (of 12): Replace Ineffective \u001b[94mRP23XX_ADC_DIV\u001b[39m Pacing with NVIC IRQ Gating and Calibrate \u001b[8b\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94;1mrp23xx_adc.c\u001b[39m Claims [\u001b[94megm-zoom-out\u001b[39m / \u001b[94megm-inventive-catalyst\u001b[39m / \u001b[94megm-design\u001b[39m / \u001b[94megm-codebase-details\u001b[39m]\u001b[m\r\n\n  • \u001b[1mScope:\u001b[m \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk63666e4deac9ec7a;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/docs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md#L25-L662\u0007Lines 25"]
[0.000, "o", "–662\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 (\u001b[94m## The Problem\u001b[m, \u001b[94m## Goals\u001b[m, \u001b[94m### 3. Boot Sequence\u001b[m, \u001b[94m### 4.1 ADC Subsystem Mitigations\u001b[m, \u001b[94m## Non-\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94mFunctional Requirements\u001b[m, \u001b[94m### Additional Resources\u001b[m, Target Files #13, #17, #30)\r\n  • \u001b[1mDescription:\u001b[m The design currently states that \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk7a417a6f1bca816e;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/nuttx/arch/arm/src/rp23xx/rp23xx_adc.c#L169-L320\u0007nuttx/arch/arm/src/rp23xx/rp23xx_adc.c:169-320\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 runs the ADC in\r\n  continuous free-running mode (\u001b[94mADC_CS_START_MANY\u001b[m) and that writing \u001b[94mputreg32(0x00ffff00, RP23XX_ADC_DIV)\u001b[m in\r\n  \u001b[94mrp23xx_bringup.c\u001b[m paces conversions to \u001b[94m~732.42 Hz\u001b[m. In the actual upstream driver, \u001b[94mrp23xx_adc.c\u001b[m never sets\r\n  \u001b[94mRP23XX_ADC_CS_START_MANY\u001b[m: \u001b[94minterrupt_handler()\u001b[m (\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkfb62f71130c5c7c2;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/nuttx/arch/arm/src/rp23xx/rp23xx_adc.c#L234\u0007line 234\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007) unconditionally calls \u001b[94mget_next_chann"]
[0.000, "o", "el()\u001b[m, which writes\r\n  single-shot \u001b[94mRP23XX_ADC_CS_START_ONCE\u001b[m (\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jke7e9122b9b2bcf93;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/nuttx/arch/arm/src/rp23xx/rp23xx_adc.c#L304\u0007line 304\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007) even when \u001b[94mau_receive()\u001b[m returns \u001b[94m-ENOMEM\u001b[m on a full software FIFO. On\r\n  RP2350 hardware, \u001b[94mRP23XX_ADC_DIV\u001b[m only paces free-running \u001b[94mSTART_MANY\u001b[m conversions and does not delay \u001b[94mSTART_ONCE\u001b[m\r\n  triggers (\u001b[94m2 µs\u001b[m/sample). Additionally, the ISR in \u001b[94mrp23xx_adc.c\u001b[m is named \u001b[94minterrupt_handler()\u001b[m (not \u001b[94madc_interrupt()\u001b[m),\r\n  and \u001b[94mremove_device(dev)\u001b[m is called from \u001b[94mmy_shutdown()\u001b[m / \u001b[94mmy_rxint(dev, false)\u001b[m ([lines 538,\r\n  563](file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxs\r\n⣟  \u001b[90mGenerating..\u001b[94m.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────"]
[0.000, "o", "────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[94m>\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90mesc to cancel\u001b[m\u001b[77X\u001b[77C\u001b[33mauto\u001b[39;2m · Gemini 4 Argon · medium\u001b[m\r\u001b[2A\u001b[2C\u001b[?2026l"]
[0.016, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[13A\u001b[9C\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkacfa1706a0ca16ba;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/docs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md#L25-L662\u0007Lines 25–662\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\n\n\u001b[27C\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkd806830f692739ae;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/nuttx/arch/arm/src/rp23xx/rp23xx_adc.c#L169-L320\u0007nuttx/arch/arm/src/rp23xx/rp23xx_adc.c:169-320\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\n\n\n\u001b[47D\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk222e211187925c02;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/nuttx/arch/arm/src/rp23xx/rp23xx_adc.c#L234\u0007line 234\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\n\u001b[3Z\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkeb43c2bf1f863d3;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/nuttx/arch/arm/src/rp23xx/rp23xx_adc.c#L304\u0007line 304\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\n\n\n\nxspace-egm/nut\r\n⡿ \n\n\u001b[?2026l"]
