[0.100, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[33A\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[37m▸ Thought for 15s\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[J\n  \u001b[1m### Breakdown Item 1 (of 12): Replace Ineffective \u001b[94mRP23XX_ADC_DIV\u001b[39m Pacing with NVIC IRQ Gating and Calibrate \u001b[8b\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94;1mrp23xx_adc.c\u001b[39m Claims [\u001b[94megm-zoom-out\u001b[39m / \u001b[94megm-inventive-catalyst\u001b[39m / \u001b[94megm-design\u001b[39m / \u001b[94megm-codebase-details\u001b[39m]\u001b[m\r\n\n  • \u001b[1mScope:\u001b[m \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk8210121c884cfa5b;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/docs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md#L25-L662\u0007Lines 25–662\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 (\u001b[94m## The Problem\u001b[m, \u001b[94m## Goals\u001b[m, \u001b[94m### 3. Boot Sequence\u001b[m, \u001b[94m### 4.1 ADC Subsystem Mitigations\u001b[m, \u001b[94m## Non-\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94mFunctional Requirements\u001b[m, \u001b[94m### Additional Resources\u001b[m, Target Files #13, #17, #30)\r\n  • \u001b[1mDescription:\u001b[m The design currently states that \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk1139f60262a66ed9;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/nuttx/arch/arm/src/rp23xx/rp23xx_adc.c#L169-L320\u0007nuttx/arch/arm/src/rp23xx/rp23xx_adc.c:169-320\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 runs the ADC in\r\n  con"]
[0.000, "o", "tinuous free-running mode (\u001b[94mADC_CS_START_MANY\u001b[m) and that writing \u001b[94mputreg32(0x00ffff00, RP23XX_ADC_DIV)\u001b[m in\r\n  \u001b[94mrp23xx_bringup.c\u001b[m paces conversions to \u001b[94m~732.42 Hz\u001b[m. In the actual upstream driver, \u001b[94mrp23xx_adc.c\u001b[m never sets\r\n  \u001b[94mRP23XX_ADC_CS_START_MANY\u001b[m: \u001b[94minterrupt_handler()\u001b[m (\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkce54663eb0f6124b;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/nuttx/arch/arm/src/rp23xx/rp23xx_adc.c#L234\u0007line 234\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007) unconditionally calls \u001b[94mget_next_channel()\u001b[m, which writes\r\n  single-shot \u001b[94mRP23XX_ADC_CS_START_ONCE\u001b[m (\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk52722b00a0fa1736;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/nuttx/arch/arm/src/rp23xx/rp23xx_adc.c#L304\u0007line 304\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007) even when \u001b[94mau_receive()\u001b[m returns \u001b[94m-ENOMEM\u001b[m on a full software FIFO. On\r\n  RP2350 hardware, \u001b[94mRP23XX_ADC_DIV\u001b[m only paces free-running \u001b[94mSTART_MANY\u001b[m conversions and does not delay \u001b[94mSTART_ONCE\u001b[m\r\n  triggers (\u001b[94m2 µs\u001b[m/sample). Additionally, the ISR in \u001b[94mrp23xx_adc.c\u001b["]
[0.000, "o", "m is named \u001b[94minterrupt_handler()\u001b[m (not \u001b[94madc_interrupt()\u001b[m),\r\n  and \u001b[94mremove_device(dev)\u001b[m is called from \u001b[94mmy_shutdown()\u001b[m / \u001b[94mmy_rxint(dev, false)\u001b[m (\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkcd792852ac85bd8;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/nuttx/arch/arm/src/rp23xx/rp23xx_adc.c#L538\u0007lines 538, 563\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007) while\r\n  \u001b[94minterrupt_handler()\u001b[m checks \u001b[94mg_active_count == 0\u001b[m (\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk4e717efad4d22857;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/nuttx/arch/arm/src/rp23xx/rp23xx_adc.c#L176\u0007line 176\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007).\r\n  • \u001b[1mAI Suggestion:\u001b[m \u001b[94mPROPOSE FIX\u001b[m\r\n  • \u001b[1mExplanation & Justification:\u001b[m Because \u001b[94mRP23XX_ADC_DIV\u001b[m does not slow down \u001b[94mSTART_ONCE\u001b[m writes, keeping \u001b[94m/dev/adc0\u001b[m open\r\n  with \u001b[94mRP23XX_ADC_IRQ_FIFO\u001b[m unmasked in the NVIC still fires \u001b[94m500,000 IRQ/s\u001b[m continuously. Since the firmware builds in\r\n  flat mode (\u001b[94mCONFIG_BUILD_FLAT=y\u001b[m), \u001b[94mbargraphd\u001b[m can keep \u001b[94m/dev/adc0\u001b[m open (avoiding the \u001b[94mmy_shutdown()\u001b[m / \u001b[94mremov"]
[0.000, "o", "e_device()\u001b[m\r\n  race) and gate \u001b[94mRP23XX_ADC_IRQ_FIFO\u001b[m at the NVIC via \u001b[94mup_disable_irq(RP23XX_ADC_IRQ_FIFO)\u001b[m and\r\n  \u001b[94mup_enable_irq(RP23XX_ADC_IRQ_FIFO)\u001b[m (\u001b[94m<nuttx/irq.h>\u001b[m and \u001b[94m<arch/rp23xx/irq.h>\u001b[m):\n\u001b[71D1. Immediately after \u001b[94mopen(\"/dev/adc0\", O_RDONLY)\u001b[m, call \u001b[94mup_disable_irq(RP23XX_ADC_IRQ_FIFO)\u001b[m. The single in-\r\n\u001b[6Cflight conversion completes in \u001b[94m2 µs\u001b[m and pends in the NVIC without firing an ISR during the \u001b[94m20 ms\u001b[m sleep window.\r\n\u001b[6C2. On each \u001b[94m50 Hz\u001b[m burst in \u001b[94mbargraph_sample_adc()\u001b[m: call \u001b[94mioctl(adc_fd, ANIOC_RESET_FIFO, 0)\u001b[m, call\n\u001b[94D\u001b[94mup_enable_irq(RP23XX_ADC_IRQ_FIFO)\u001b[m, read \u001b[94m5\u001b[m \u001b[94mstruct adc_msg_s\u001b[m entries (\u001b[94m~10 µs\u001b[m), immediately call\n\u001b[94D\u001b[94mup_disable_irq(RP23XX_ADC_IRQ_FIFO)\u001b[m, discard \u001b[94mmsgs[0]\u001b[m (the 1 sample latched at the end of the previous cycle),\r\n\u001b[6Cand average the 4 fresh samples \u001b[94mmsgs[1..4]\u001b[m.\n\u001b[43D3. On \u001b[94mbargraph stop\u001b[m, call \u001b[94mup_enable_irq(RP23XX_ADC_IRQ_FIFO)\u001b[m right bef"]
[0.000, "o", "ore \u001b[94mclose(adc_fd)\u001b[m so \u001b[94minterrupt_handler()\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6Cexecutes its \u001b[94mg_acti\u001b[m\r\n\n⣽  \u001b[90mGenerating...\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m└ Tip: Press ? to see keyboard shortcuts.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[94m>\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90mesc to cancel\u001b[m\u001b[77X\u001b[77C\u001b[33mauto\u001b[39;2m · Gemini 4 Argon · medium\u001b[m\r\u001b[2A\u001b[2C\u001b[?2026l"]
