[0.034, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[33A\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[1;34m> accept\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[J\n  \u001b[1m### Breakdown Item 2 (of 12): Fix Fixed-Point Q4 EMA Filter Right-Shift Bug (\u001b[94m>> 2\u001b[39m vs \u001b[94m>> 4\u001b[39m) and Seed First Sample   \u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[1m[\u001b[94megm-codebase-details\u001b[39m / \u001b[94megm-implementation-readiness\u001b[39m]\u001b[m\r\n\n  • \u001b[1mScope:\u001b[m \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk33b0fa155d929a3b;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/docs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md#L253-L254\u0007Lines 253–254\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkd5c6b54845fe99d6;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/docs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md#L662\u0007Line 662\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 (\u001b[94m### 4.1 ADC Subsystem Mitigations\u001b[m, Target File #30 \u001b[94mbargraph_main.c\u001b[m)\r\n  • \u001b[1mDescription:\u001b[m Line 254 defines the Q4 exponential moving average (EMA) update as:\n\n\u001b[80D\u001b[38;5;252mema\\_q4 ← ema\\_q4 - (ema\\_q"]
[0.000, "o", "4 ≫ 2) + (raw\\_avg ≪ 2),   filtered = ema\\_q4 ≫ 2\u001b[m\r\n\n  At steady state for a constant input raw_avg = R, ema_q4/4 = 4R ⟹ ema_q4 = 16R = R ≪ 4. Shifting \u001b[94mema_q4\u001b[m right by \u001b[94m2\u001b[m\r\n  (\u001b[94mema_q4 >> 2\u001b[m) yields 4R ∈ [0, 16380] instead of R ∈ [0, 4095]. In addition, Target File #30 (line 662) does not\r\n  specify seeding \u001b[94mema_q4\u001b[m on the first sample after startup.\r\n\n  • \u001b[1mAI Suggestion:\u001b[m \u001b[94mPROPOSE FIX\u001b[m\r\n  • \u001b[1mExplanation & Justification:\u001b[m With \u001b[94mfiltered = ema_q4 >> 2\u001b[m, \u001b[94mfiltered\u001b[m reaches \u001b[94m4095\u001b[m at only \u001b[94m25%\u001b[m of potentiometer\r\n  rotation (\u001b[94mraw_avg = 1024\u001b[m), saturating all 6 LEDs at \u001b[94m100%\u001b[m duty across the upper \u001b[94m75%\u001b[m of travel. Because \u001b[94mema_q4\u001b[m holds\r\n  a Q4 fixed-point value (16 × R), extracting the integer count with rounding requires \u001b[94m(ema_q4 + 8) >> 4\u001b[m, and seeding\r\n  \u001b[94mema_q4 = (uint32_t)raw_avg << 4\u001b[m on the first sample (\u001b[94m!ema_initialized\u001b[m) ensures the bar graph starts at the actual\r\n  wiper readi"]
[0.000, "o", "ng immediately upon power-on without ramping up from zero.\r\n  • \u001b[1mProposed Edit:\u001b[m\n\u001b[12D• Location: \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk877b92a6b3c8860c;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/docs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md#L254\u0007Line 254\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 and \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkd5c6b74845fe9d3c;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/docs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md#L662\u0007Line 662\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\n\u001b[33D• Change: Update the formula on line 254 to:\n\n\n\u001b[46D\u001b[38;5;252mema\\_q4 ← ema\\_q4 - (ema\\_q4 ≫ 2) + (raw\\_avg ≪ 2),   filtered = (ema\\_q4 + 8) ≫ 4\u001b[m\n\n\u001b[82D\u001b[38;5;252mand state in Section 4.1.5 and Target File #30 (line 662) that on the first sample burst after daemon start\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;252m(`!ema_initialized`), `ema_q4` is initialized directly to `(uint32_t)raw_avg << 4`.\u001b[m\r\n\n  How would\r\n⣾  \u001b[90mWorkin\u001b[94mg...\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m└ Tip: Press ctrl+b to send a long task to the background.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────"]
