[0.018, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[33A• \u001b[1mAI Suggestion:\u001b[m \u001b[94mPROPOSE FIX\u001b[m\n\u001b[26D\u001b[1mExplanation & Justification:\u001b[m With \u001b[94mfiltered = ema_q4 >> 2\u001b[m, \u001b[94mfiltered\u001b[m reaches \u001b[94m4095\u001b[m at only \u001b[94m25%\u001b[m of potentiometer\r\n  rotation (\u001b[94mraw_avg = 1024\u001b[m), saturating all 6 LEDs at \u001b[94m100%\u001b[m duty across the upper \u001b[94m75%\u001b[m of travel. Because \u001b[94mema_q4\u001b[m holds\r\n  a Q4 fixed-point value (16 × R), extracting the integer count with rounding requires \u001b[94m(ema_q4 + 8) >> 4\u001b[m, and seeding\r\n  \u001b[94mema_q4 = (uint32_t)raw_avg << 4\u001b[m on the first sample (\u001b[94m!ema_initialized\u001b[m) ensures the bar graph starts at the actual\u001b[K\r\n  wiper reading immediately upon power-on without ramping up from zero.\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mProposed Edit:\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n      • Location: \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk8de11c21f31d2c84;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/docs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md#L254\u0007Line 254\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 and \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkc65261cdaf0b0074;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/docs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.m"]
[0.000, "o", "d#L662\u0007Line 662\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\n\tChange: Update the formula on line 254 to:\r\n\u001b[K\n\n\u001b[4C\u001b[38;5;252mema\\_q4 ← ema\\_q4 - (ema\\_q4 ≫ 2) + (raw\\_avg ≪ 2),   filtered = (ema\\_q4 + 8) ≫ 4\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[4C\u001b[38;5;252mand state in Section 4.1.5 and Target File #30 (line 662) that on the first sample burst after daemon start\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;252m(`!ema_initialized`), `ema_q4` is initialized directly to `(uint32_t)raw_avg << 4`.\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  How would you like to proceed with \u001b[1mItem 2\u001b[m? Please reply with \u001b[1mAccept proposed fix\u001b[m, \u001b[1mSkip / ignore\u001b[m, or \u001b[1mDiscuss\u001b[m.\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m> accept\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u001b[1m### Breakdown Item 3 (of 12): Remove Non-Existent \u001b[94mCONFIG_PWM_MULTICHAN=y\u001b[39m and Add Required \u001b[94mCONFIG_ANALOG=y\u001b[39m in \u001b[6b\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94;1mdefconfig\u001b[39m [\u001b[94megm-design\u001b[39m / \u001b[94megm-codebase-details\u001b[39m / \u001b[94megm-impl"]
[0.000, "o", "ementation-readiness\u001b[39m]\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  • \u001b[1mScope:\u001b[m \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk3ba96832469af95d;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/docs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md#L260\u0007Line 260\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkaef557bf80df3804;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/docs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md#L457\u0007Line 457\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkdb8b3da71655e185;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/docs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md#L464\u0007Line 464\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 (\u001b[94m### 4.2 Hardware PWM Subsystem Mitigations\u001b[m, Target File #7 \u001b[94mdefconfig\u001b[m)\r\n\u001b[4C\u001b[1mDescription:\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n      1. Lines 260 and 457 specify setting \u001b[94mCONFIG_PWM_MULTICHAN=y\u001b[m in \u001b[94mxiao-rp2350-\u001b[m\n\u001b[75D\u001b[94mbargraph/board/configs/bargraph/defconfig\u001b[m. However,\u001b[K\n\u001b[51D[nuttx/drivers/timers/Kconfig](file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-\n\u001b[79Degm/nuttx/drivers/timers/Kconfig#L3\u001b[K\n\n\n\n\u001b[39D\u001b[?2026l"]
