[0.017, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[33AHow would you like to proceed with \u001b[1mItem 2\u001b[m? Please reply with \u001b[1mAccept proposed fix\u001b[m, \u001b[1mSkip / ignore\u001b[m, or \u001b[1mDiscuss\u001b[m.\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m> accept\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u001b[1m### Breakdown Item 3 (of 12): Remove Non-Existent \u001b[94mCONFIG_PWM_MULTICHAN=y\u001b[39m and Add Required \u001b[94mCONFIG_ANALOG=y\u001b[39m in \u001b[6b\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94;1mdefconfig\u001b[39m [\u001b[94megm-design\u001b[39m / \u001b[94megm-codebase-details\u001b[39m / \u001b[94megm-implementation-readiness\u001b[39m]\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  • \u001b[1mScope:\u001b[m \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk4fc3286580d9ce45;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/docs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md#L260\u0007Line 260\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk980598fc47d5878c;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/docs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md#L457\u0007Line 457\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkd9cb3ee47a4ca98d;file:///Users/brett/Documents/G"]
[0.000, "o", "itHub/nuttxspace-egm/docs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md#L464\u0007Line 464\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 (\u001b[94m### 4.2 Hardware PWM Subsystem Mitigations\u001b[m, Target File #7 \u001b[94mdefconfig\u001b[m)\r\n\u001b[4C\u001b[1mDescription:\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n      1. Lines 260 and 457 specify setting \u001b[94mCONFIG_PWM_MULTICHAN=y\u001b[m in \u001b[94mxiao-rp2350-\u001b[m\n\u001b[75D\u001b[94mbargraph/board/configs/bargraph/defconfig\u001b[m. However, \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkab6601f3e5e8219a;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/nuttx/drivers/timers/Kconfig#L37-L71\u0007nuttx/drivers/timers/Kconfig:37-71\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 does not define\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mPWM_MULTICHAN\u001b[m (it defines \u001b[94mconfig PWM_NCHANNELS\u001b[m directly under \u001b[94mif PWM\u001b[m, whereas \u001b[94march/arm/src/rp23xx/Kconfig\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6Cdefines \u001b[94mRP23XX_PWM_MULTICHAN\u001b[m and \u001b[94mRP23XX_PWM_NCHANNELS\u001b[m). In \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkc207e1f7acfb59;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/nuttx/tools/Unix.mk#L725-L734\u0007nuttx/tools/Unix.mk:725-734\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[94molddefconfig\u001b[m treats any\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mkconfiglib\u001b[m warning (such as an unknown symbol in \u001b[94mdefconfig"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[m) as a fatal error (\u001b[94mexit 1\u001b[m).\u001b[K\n\u001b[86D2. Line 464 specifies \u001b[94mCONFIG_ADC=y\u001b[m, \u001b[94mCONFIG_ADC_FIFOSIZE=16\u001b[m, \u001b[94mCONFIG_RP23XX_ADC=y\u001b[m, and\u001b[K\n\u001b[84D\u001b[94mCONFIG_RP23XX_ADC_CHANNEL0=y\u001b[m, but omits \u001b[94mCONFIG_ANALOG=y\u001b[m. In \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk1b4741fbf06ec892;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/nuttx/drivers/analog/Kconfig#L6-L20\u0007nuttx/drivers/analog/Kconfig:6-20\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[94mconfig ADC\u001b[m is\r\n\u001b[6Cnested inside \u001b[94mif ANALOG\u001b[m (\u001b[94mmenuconfig ANALOG\u001b[m, \u001b[94mdefault n\u001b[m). Without \u001b[94mCONFIG_ANALOG=y\u001b[m, \u001b[94molddefconfig\u001b[m drops\u001b[K\n\u001b[99D\u001b[94mCONFIG_ADC=y\u001b[m and \u001b[94m/dev/adc0\u001b[m is never compiled or registered.\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mAI Suggestion:\u001b[m \u001b[94mPROPOSE FIX\u001b[m\u001b[K\n\u001b[26D\u001b[1mExplanation & Justification:\u001b[m Removing the non-existent \u001b[94mCONFIG_PWM_MULTICHAN=y\u001b[m symbol and adding \u001b[94mCONFIG_ANALOG=y\u001b[m\r\n  ensures \u001b[94m./tools/configure.sh -l ../xiao-rp2350-bargraph/board/configs/bargraph\u001b[m succeeds with zero Kconfig warnings\r\n  and compiles both the upper-half and lower-"]
[0.000, "o", "half ADC and multi-channel PWM drivers.\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mProposed Edit:\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n      • Location: \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk4fc3226580d9c413;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/docs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md#L260\u0007Line 260\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk9805a2fc47d5988a;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/docs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md#L457\u0007Line 457\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, and \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkd9cb34e47a4c988f;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/docs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md#L464\u0007Line 464\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\n\tChange:\u001b[K\n\u001b[9D    • On lines 260 and 457, remove \u001b[94mCONFIG_PWM_MULTICHAN=y\u001b[m so the multi-channel PWM symbol list is \u001b[94mCONFIG_PWM=y\u001b[m,\r\n\t  \u001b[94mCONFI\u001b[m\u001b[K\n\n\n\n\n\n\u001b[13D\u001b[?2026l"]
