[0.066, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[33A\u001b[4C\u001b[94mbargraph/board/configs/bargraph/defconfig\u001b[m. However, \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkf6b95feefbecb829;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/nuttx/drivers/timers/Kconfig#L37-L71\u0007nuttx/drivers/timers/Kconfig:37-71\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 does not define\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mPWM_MULTICHAN\u001b[m (it defines \u001b[94mconfig PWM_NCHANNELS\u001b[m directly under \u001b[94mif PWM\u001b[m, whereas \u001b[94march/arm/src/rp23xx/Kconfig\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6Cdefines \u001b[94mRP23XX_PWM_MULTICHAN\u001b[m and \u001b[94mRP23XX_PWM_NCHANNELS\u001b[m). In \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk33c7b896f95c2820;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/nuttx/tools/Unix.mk#L725-L734\u0007nuttx/tools/Unix.mk:725-734\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[94molddefconfig\u001b[m treats any\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mkconfiglib\u001b[m warning (such as an unknown symbol in \u001b[94mdefconfig\u001b[m) as a fatal error (\u001b[94mexit 1\u001b[m).\u001b[K\n\u001b[86D2. Line 464 specifies \u001b[94mCONFIG_ADC=y\u001b[m, \u001b[94mCONFIG_ADC_FIFOSIZE=16\u001b[m, \u001b[94mCONFIG_RP23XX_ADC=y\u001b[m, and\u001b[K\n\u001b[84D\u001b[94mCONFIG_RP23XX_ADC_CHANNEL0=y\u001b[m, but omits \u001b[94mCONFIG_ANALOG=y\u001b[m. In \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jked6c08d2f9152c1b;file://"]
[0.000, "o", "/Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/nuttx/drivers/analog/Kconfig#L6-L20\u0007nuttx/drivers/analog/Kconfig:6-20\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[94mconfig ADC\u001b[m is\r\n\u001b[6Cnested inside \u001b[94mif ANALOG\u001b[m (\u001b[94mmenuconfig ANALOG\u001b[m, \u001b[94mdefault n\u001b[m). Without \u001b[94mCONFIG_ANALOG=y\u001b[m, \u001b[94molddefconfig\u001b[m drops\u001b[K\n\u001b[99D\u001b[94mCONFIG_ADC=y\u001b[m and \u001b[94m/dev/adc0\u001b[m is never compiled or registered.\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mAI Suggestion:\u001b[m \u001b[94mPROPOSE FIX\u001b[m\u001b[K\n\u001b[26D\u001b[1mExplanation & Justification:\u001b[m Removing the non-existent \u001b[94mCONFIG_PWM_MULTICHAN=y\u001b[m symbol and adding \u001b[94mCONFIG_ANALOG=y\u001b[m\r\n  ensures \u001b[94m./tools/configure.sh -l ../xiao-rp2350-bargraph/board/configs/bargraph\u001b[m succeeds with zero Kconfig warnings\r\n  and compiles both the upper-half and lower-half ADC and multi-channel PWM drivers.\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mProposed Edit:\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n      • Location: \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkfbeb8fa296b1c746;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/docs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md#L260\u0007Line 260\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk333e57b28be86a2b;file:/"]
[0.000, "o", "//Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/docs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md#L457\u0007Line 457\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, and \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkcc095da9c4da5dca;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/docs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md#L464\u0007Line 464\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\n\tChange:\u001b[K\n\u001b[9D    • On lines 260 and 457, remove \u001b[94mCONFIG_PWM_MULTICHAN=y\u001b[m so the multi-channel PWM symbol list is \u001b[94mCONFIG_PWM=y\u001b[m,\r\n\t  \u001b[94mCONFIG_PWM_NCHANNELS=2\u001b[m, \u001b[94mCONFIG_RP23XX_PWM=y\u001b[m, \u001b[94mCONFIG_RP23XX_PWM_MULTICHAN=y\u001b[m, \u001b[94mCONFIG_RP23XX_PWM_NCHANNELS=2\u001b[m.\u001b[K\r\n\t  • On line 464, add \u001b[94mCONFIG_ANALOG=y\u001b[m before \u001b[94mCONFIG_ADC=y\u001b[m.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\n\n  How would you like to proceed with \u001b[1mItem 3\u001b[m? Please reply with \u001b[1mAccept proposed fix\u001b[m, \u001b[1mSkip / ignore\u001b[m, or \u001b[1mDiscuss\u001b[m.\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m> accept\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u001b[1m### Breakdown Item 4"]
