[0.083, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\n\n\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[35A  \u001b[1m### Breakdown Item 5 (of 12): Define \"EGM\" and Link to Local EGM \u001b[94mREADME.md\u001b[39m Structural Conventions on First Use \u001b[4b\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[1m[\u001b[94megm-comprehension\u001b[39m]\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  • \u001b[1mScope:\u001b[m \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkccfc4ccb9c4d9eb0;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/docs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md#L36\u0007Line 36\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk40519aa6cb77bc44;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/docs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md#L409-L600\u0007Lines 409–600\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 (\u001b[94m## Goals\u001b[m, \u001b[94m## Detailed Implementation Plan\u001b[m)\n\u001b[73D\u001b[1mDescription:\u001b[m The document repeatedly uses the terms \"EGM \u001b[94mREADME.md\u001b[m contracts\", \"Top-Level Workspace EGM Blueprint\r\n  Documentation\", \"Leaf EGM Documentation\", and bracketed symbol notation such as \u001b[94m[board.h:BOARD_SYS_FREQ]\u001b[m (lines 472,\r\n  488), without defining what \"EGM\" stands for or linking to existing workspace \u001b[94mREADME.md\u001b[m exemplars.\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mAI Suggestion:\u001b[m \u001b[94mPROPOSE FIX\u001b[m\u001b[K\n\u001b[26D\u001b[1mEx"]
[0.000, "o", "planation & Justification:\u001b[m A reader who is new to the repository needs an inline definition of EGM (Elephant /\r\n  Goldfish Memory) directory \u001b[94mREADME.md\u001b[m contracts on first mention (line 36) and links to existing non-leaf\u001b[K\r\n  (\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk66c385f1b0c49478;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/README.md\u0007README.md\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007) and leaf (\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk93b3417efcb40ac2;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/nuttx/boards/arm/rp23xx/xiao-rp2350/src/README.md\u0007nuttx/boards/arm/rp23xx/xiao-rp2350/src/README.md\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007) exemplars in the workspace so the required\r\n  section headers (\u001b[94mOverview\u001b[m, \u001b[94mSubdirectories & Boundaries\u001b[m or \u001b[94mInterface\u001b[m, \u001b[94mInvariants\u001b[m, \u001b[94mSide Effects\u001b[m, \u001b[94mVerification\u001b[m) and\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[94m[file:symbol]\u001b[m citation format are clear.\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mProposed Edit:\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n      • Location: \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkccfc50cb9c4da57c;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/docs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md#L36\u0007Line 36\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 and \u001b["]
[0.000, "o", "94m## Detailed Implementation Plan\u001b[m (\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkc5ea308bfe4b7aeb;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/docs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md#L405\u0007Line 405\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007)\r\n\tChange:\u001b[K\n\u001b[9D    • On line 36, expand \"EGM \u001b[94mREADME.md\u001b[m contracts\" to: \"Elephant/Goldfish Memory (EGM) \u001b[94mREADME.md\u001b[m\r\n\t  contracts—structured directory documentation following the workspace non-leaf blueprint format (\u001b[94;1m\u001b]8;id=jkbdb818a8c2049483;../../README.md\u0007README.md\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\n\t  \u001b[4m\u001b]8;id=jkbdb818a8c2049483;../../README.md\u0007/README.md\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007: \u001b[94mOverview\u001b[m, \u001b[94mSubdirectories & Boundaries\u001b[m, \u001b[94mInvariants\u001b[m, \u001b[94mSide Effects\u001b[m, \u001b[94mVerification\u001b[m) and leaf\u001b[K\r\n\t  contract format (\u001b[94;1m\u001b]8;id=jk63bbdd2cd63bc2b9;../../nuttx/boards/arm/rp23xx/xiao-rp2350/src/README.md\u0007nuttx/boards/arm/rp23xx/xiao-rp2350/src/README.md\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 \u001b[4m\u001b]8;id=jk63bbdd2cd63bc2b9;../../nuttx/boards/arm/rp23xx/xiao-rp2350/src/README.md\u0007/nuttx/boards/arm/rp23xx/xiao-\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[K\r\n\t  \u001b[4m\u001b]8;id=jk63bbdd2cd63bc2b9;../"]
