[0.018, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[31AHow would you like to proceed with \u001b[1mItem 5\u001b[m? Please reply with \u001b[1mAccept proposed fix\u001b[m, \u001b[1mSkip / ignore\u001b[m, or \u001b[1mDiscuss\u001b[m.\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m> accept\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u001b[1m### Breakdown Item 6 (of 12): Guard \u001b[94mapps/external\u001b[39m Symlink Creation During \u001b[94mdistclean\u001b[39m, Remove Symlink in \u001b[12b\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94;1mapps/Makefile\u001b[39m, and Add \u001b[94m.gitignore\u001b[39m [\u001b[94megm-design\u001b[39m / \u001b[94megm-zoom-out\u001b[39m / \u001b[94megm-implementation-readiness\u001b[39m]\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  • \u001b[1mScope:\u001b[m \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk56548fd2be420467;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/docs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md#L85-L123\u0007Lines 85–123\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk24d5bd92113b8225;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/docs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md#L141-L150\u0007Lines 141–150\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk88290"]
[0.000, "o", "d91d01b64c6;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/docs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md#L384\u0007Line 384\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkffe5067f2a68584d;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/docs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md#L496\u0007Line 496\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkc1f1de280764faa1;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/docs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md#L585\u0007Line 585\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 (\u001b[94m### 1. System Architecture\u001b[m, Target File #11\r\n  \u001b[94mboard/scripts/Make.defs\u001b[m, Target File #23 \u001b[94mapps/Makefile\u001b[m)\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mDescription:\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n      1. In \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkde3541261826ad41;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/nuttx/tools/Unix.mk#L873-L883\u0007nuttx/tools/Unix.mk:873-883\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[94mmake distclean\u001b[m invokes \u001b[94m$(MAKE) clean_context\u001b[m \u001b[3mafter\u001b[m \u001b[94msubdir_distclean\u001b[m, which\r\n\u001b[6Cre-includes \u001b[94mMake.defs\u001b[m before deleting \u001b[94mMake.defs\u001b[m at line 882. An unguarded \u001b[94m$(shell ln -s ...)\u001b[m in \u001b[94mxiao-rp2350-\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mbargraph/board/s"]
[0.000, "o", "cripts/Make.defs\u001b[m immediately recreates \u001b[94mapps/external\u001b[m during \u001b[94mclean_context\u001b[m. If \u001b[94mapps/external\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[6Cremains after \u001b[94mdistclean\u001b[m, subsequent in-tree configurations in the workspace still pick up \u001b[94mapps/external/Make.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mdefs\u001b[m and \u001b[94mapps/external/Kconfig\u001b[m.\u001b[K\n\u001b[31D2. Building \u001b[94mapps/external/bargraph\u001b[m generates \u001b[94m.depend\u001b[m, \u001b[94mMake.dep\u001b[m, \u001b[94m.built\u001b[m, \u001b[94m.kconfig\u001b[m, and \u001b[94m*.o\u001b[m inside \u001b[94mxiao-rp2350-\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mbargraph/apps/\u001b[m. Without a \u001b[94m.gitignore\u001b[m in \u001b[94mxiao-rp2350-bargraph/\u001b[m, those generated build files appear as untracked\r\n\u001b[6Cfiles in the top-level repository during an active build.\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mAI Suggestion:\u001b[m \u001b[94mPROPOSE FIX\u001b[m\u001b[K\n\u001b[26D\u001b[1mExplanation & Justification:\u001b[m Guarding the \u001b[94m$(shell ...)\u001b[m symlink creation in \u001b[94mboard/scripts/Make.defs\u001b[m with \u001b[94mifeq\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94m($(filter distclean clean_context apps_distclean,$(MAKECMDGOALS)),)\u001b[m, removing \u001b[94m$(APPDIR)/external\u001b[m (\u001b[94mrm -f\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[94"]
[0.000, "o", "m\"$(APPDIR)/external\"\u001b[m) in \u001b[94mxiao-rp2350-bargraph/apps/Makefile\u001b[m's \u001b[94mdistclean\u001b[m target, and adding \u001b[94mxiao-rp2350-bargraph/.\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94mgitignore\u001b[m (ignoring \u001b[94m*.o\u001b[m, \u001b[94m.built\u001b[m, \u001b[94m.depend\u001b[m, \u001b[94m.kconfig\u001b[m, \u001b[94mMake.dep\u001b[m, \u001b[94m.context\u001b[m) ensures both submodules and the\u001b[K\r\n  superproject stay clean across build and \u001b[94mdistclean\u001b[m lifecycles.\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mProposed Edit:\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n      • Location: [Lines 85–123](file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/docs/designs/xiao-rp2350-\r\n\u001b[6Cbargraph.md#L85-\u001b[K\n\n\n\n\u001b[20D\u001b[?2026l"]
