[0.000, "o", ";34;4m8\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4m4\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u001b\\, \u001b]8;id=jkc33bdf3e4b4d3a7d;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/docs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md#L496\u001b\\\u001b[4;34;4mL\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mi\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mn\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4me\u001b[m\u001b[34;4m \u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4m4\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4m9\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4m6\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u001b\\, \u001b]8;id=jk854936e7284ab651;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/docs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md#L585\u001b\\\u001b[4;34;4mL\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mi\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mn\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4me\u001b[m\u001b[34;4m \u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4m5\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4m8\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4m5\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u001b\\ (\u001b[94m### 1. System Architecture\u001b[m, Target File #11\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[J  \u001b[94mboard/scripts/Make.defs\u001b[m, Target File #23 \u001b[94mapps/Makefile\u001b[m)\r\n  • \u001b[1mDescription:\u001b[m\n\u001b[10D1. In \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkd72a555aeb83842f;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/nuttx/tools/Unix.mk#L873-L883\u0007nuttx/tools/Unix.mk:873-883\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[94mmake distclean\u001b[m invokes \u001b[94m$(MAKE) clean_context\u001b[m \u001b[3mafter\u001b[m \u001b[94msubdir_distclean\u001b[m, which\r\n\u001b[6Cre-includes \u001b[94mMake.defs\u001b[m before deleting \u001b[94mMake.defs\u001b[m at line 882. An unguarde"]
[0.000, "o", "d \u001b[94m$(shell ln -s ...)\u001b[m in \u001b[94mxiao-rp2350-\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mbargraph/board/scripts/Make.defs\u001b[m immediately recreates \u001b[94mapps/external\u001b[m during \u001b[94mclean_context\u001b[m. If \u001b[94mapps/external\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6Cremains after \u001b[94mdistclean\u001b[m, subsequent in-tree configurations in the workspace still pick up \u001b[94mapps/external/Make.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mdefs\u001b[m and \u001b[94mapps/external/Kconfig\u001b[m.\n\u001b[31D2. Building \u001b[94mapps/external/bargraph\u001b[m generates \u001b[94m.depend\u001b[m, \u001b[94mMake.dep\u001b[m, \u001b[94m.built\u001b[m, \u001b[94m.kconfig\u001b[m, and \u001b[94m*.o\u001b[m inside \u001b[94mxiao-rp2350-\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mbargraph/apps/\u001b[m. Without a \u001b[94m.gitignore\u001b[m in \u001b[94mxiao-rp2350-bargraph/\u001b[m, those generated build files appear as untracked\r\n\u001b[6Cfiles in the top-level repository during an active build.\r\n  • \u001b[1mAI Suggestion:\u001b[m \u001b[94mPROPOSE FIX\u001b[m\r\n  • \u001b[1mExplanation & Justification:\u001b[m Guarding the \u001b[94m$(shell ...)\u001b[m symlink creation in \u001b[94mboard/scripts/Make.defs\u001b[m with \u001b[94mifeq\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94m($(filter distclean clean_context apps_distclean,$(MAKECMDGOALS)"]
[0.000, "o", "),)\u001b[m, removing \u001b[94m$(APPDIR)/external\u001b[m (\u001b[94mrm -f\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94m\"$(APPDIR)/external\"\u001b[m) in \u001b[94mxiao-rp2350-bargraph/apps/Makefile\u001b[m's \u001b[94mdistclean\u001b[m target, and adding \u001b[94mxiao-rp2350-bargraph/.\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94mgitignore\u001b[m (ignoring \u001b[94m*.o\u001b[m, \u001b[94m.built\u001b[m, \u001b[94m.depend\u001b[m, \u001b[94m.kconfig\u001b[m, \u001b[94mMake.dep\u001b[m, \u001b[94m.context\u001b[m) ensures both submodules and the\r\n  superproject stay clean across build and \u001b[94mdistclean\u001b[m lifecycles.\r\n  • \u001b[1mProposed Edit:\u001b[m\n\u001b[12D• Location: \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkbcd93200ddf63d3f;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/docs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md#L85-L123\u0007Lines 85–123\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk768956341407a3cd;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/docs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md#L141-L150\u0007Lines 141–150\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk18b30f229a40e016;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/docs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md#L384\u0007Line 384\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk29a6e558aa103bf4;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/n"]
