[0.017, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[33AHow would you like to proceed with \u001b[1mItem 6\u001b[m? Please reply with \u001b[1mAccept proposed fix\u001b[m, \u001b[1mSkip / ignore\u001b[m, or \u001b[1mDiscuss\u001b[m.\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m> accept\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u001b[1m### Breakdown Item 7 (of 12): Omit Unused Board Source Files (\u001b[94mrp23xx_autoleds.c\u001b[39m, \u001b[94mrp23xx_userleds.c\u001b[39m, \u001b[94mrp23xx_gpio.c\u001b[39m) \u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[1mand Simplify \u001b[94mbargraph_shutdown_pwm()\u001b[39m [\u001b[94megm-zoom-out\u001b[39m / \u001b[94megm-implementation-readiness\u001b[39m]\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  • \u001b[1mScope:\u001b[m \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk3bd4102753417225;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/docs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md#L23\u0007Line 23\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkb25b9c5db023eac7;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/docs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md#L108-L110\u0007Lines 108–110\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkce724219b2bf3a67;file:///Use"]
[0.000, "o", "rs/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/docs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md#L279-L280\u0007Lines 279–280\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk3186c681afe1dc78;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/docs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md#L511-L520\u0007Lines 511–520\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkbb7c9007867bddf3;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/docs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md#L545-L565\u0007Lines 545–565\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk78206acfd0da19;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/docs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md#L658-L659\u0007Lines 658–659\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 (\u001b[94m### 1. System\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94mArchitecture\u001b[m, \u001b[94m### 4.2 Hardware PWM Subsystem Mitigations\u001b[m, Target Files #13, #14, #18, #19, #20, #30)\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mDescription:\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n      1. \u001b[1mUnused Board Files (\u001b[94;22mrp23xx_autoleds.c\u001b[39;1m, \u001b[94;22mrp23xx_userleds.c\u001b[39;1m, \u001b[94;22mrp23xx_gpio.c\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m: In \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk38b0e6d21b061162;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/nuttx/boards/Kconfig#L4077-L4120\u0007nuttx/"]
[0.000, "o", "boards/Kconfig:4077-4120\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007,\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mCONFIG_ARCH_BOARD_CUSTOM=y\u001b[m does not select \u001b[94mARCH_HAVE_LEDS\u001b[m unless \u001b[94mCONFIG_BOARD_CUSTOM_LEDS=y\u001b[m is enabled, and\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[6Cneither \u001b[94mCONFIG_USERLED\u001b[m nor \u001b[94mCONFIG_DEV_GPIO\u001b[m is enabled in \u001b[94mdefconfig\u001b[m. Nothing in the kernel or\u001b[K\n\u001b[92D\u001b[94mboards/arm/rp23xx/common\u001b[m calls \u001b[94mboard_autoled_*\u001b[m, \u001b[94mboard_userled_*\u001b[m, or \u001b[94mrp23xx_dev_gpio_init()\u001b[m when those options\r\n\u001b[6Care off (and \u001b[94mrp23xx_boardearlyinitialize()\u001b[m in \u001b[94mrp23xx_boardinitialize.c\u001b[m already initializes the onboard \u001b[94mGPIO25\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6CLED directly). Furthermore, \u001b[94mrp23xx_gpio.c\u001b[m from \u001b[94mxiao-rp2350\u001b[m hardcodes \u001b[94mGPIO26..28\u001b[m (\u001b[94mD0..D2\u001b[m), colliding with \u001b[94mADC0\u001b[m,\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mLED1\u001b[m, and \u001b[94mLED2\u001b[m.\u001b[K\n\u001b[15D2. \u001b[1mPWM Shutdown (\u001b[94;22mpwm_stop()\u001b[39;1m vs. \u001b[94;22mpwm_shutdown()\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m: In \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkcf3e69bfec83bc9;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/nuttx/arch/arm/src/rp23xx/rp23xx_pwm.c#L643-L650\u0007nuttx/arch/arm/"]
[0.000, "o", "src/rp23xx/rp23xx_pwm.c:643-650\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[94mpwm_stop()\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C(\u001b[94mPWMIOC_STOP\u001b[m) only clears \u001b[94m1 << priv->num\u001b[m in \u001b[94mRP23XX_PWM_EN\u001b[m (leaving the pad frozen while the descriptor remains\r\n\u001b[6Copen), whereas \u001b[94mclose(fd)\u001b[m invokes \u001b[94mpwm_shutdown()\u001b[m (\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jka26dae37babe36ff;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/nuttx/arch/arm/src/rp23xx/rp23xx_pwm.c#L249-L318\u0007nuttx/arch/arm/src/rp23xx/rp23xx_pwm.c:249-318\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007), which calls\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mpwm_stop()\u001b[m, configures \u001b[94mpin[0]\u001b[m and \u001b[94mpin[1]\u001b[m as outputs driven low (\u001b[94m0\u001b[m), switches their mux to \u001b[94mRP23XX_GPIO_FUNC_SIO\u001b[m,\r\n\u001b[6Cand zeros \u001b[94mpriv->duty[]\u001b[m.\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mAI Suggestion:\u001b[m \u001b[94mPROPOSE FIX\u001b[m\n\u001b[26D\u001b[1mExplanation & Justification:\u001b[m Omitting \u001b[94mrp23xx_autoleds.c\u001b[m, \u001b[94mrp23xx_userleds.c\u001b[m, and \u001b[94mrp23xx_gpio.c\u001b[m from \u001b[94mxiao-rp2350-\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94mbargraph/board/src/\u001b[m (\u001b[94mCSRCS = rp23xx_boardinitialize.c rp23xx_bringup.c\u001b[m) eliminates ~750 lines of dead code and\u001b[K\r\n  removes "]
[0.000, "o", "the latent \u001b[94mGPIO26..28\u001b[m pin-mux collision. In \u001b[94mbargraph_shutdown_pwm()\u001b[m, zeroing the duties, issuing\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[94mPWMIOC_STOP\u001b[m (which resets \u001b[94mupper->started = false\u001b[m in \u001b[94mdrivers/timers/pwm.c:428\u001b[m), and calling \u001b[94mclose(fd)\u001b[m (which invokes\r\n  \u001b[94mpwm_shutdown()\u001b[m to drive the pins low via \u001b[94mRP23XX_GPIO_FUNC_SIO\u001b[m) guarantees every LED turns off cleanly without\u001b[K\r\n  needing an artif\u001b[K\n\n\n\n\u001b[16D\u001b[?2026l"]
[0.016, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[25A\u001b[9C\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk883a6b3a4006dcb8;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/docs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md#L23\u0007Line 23\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk87eee348234df7b2;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/docs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md#L108-L110\u0007Lines 108–110\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk8bc7ce5eca80f77e;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/docs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md#L279-L280\u0007Lines 279–280\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk6705e6b1a88debd5;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/docs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md#L511-L520\u0007Lines 511–520\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk71204ec57cf6f622;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/docs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md#L545-L565\u0007Lines 545–565\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkeb5db33f8f9b311c;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/docs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md#L658-L659\u0007Lines 658–659\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\n\n\n\u001b[7D\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkaae0fdd9fd94030b;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHu"]
