[0.018, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[33A      1. \u001b[1mUnused Board Files (\u001b[m\u001b[94mrp23xx_autoleds.c\u001b[m\u001b[1m, \u001b[m\u001b[94mrp23xx_userleds.c\u001b[m\u001b[1m, \u001b[m\u001b[94mrp23xx_gpio.c\u001b[m\u001b[1m)\u001b[m: In \u001b]8;id=jkdc7fde614f238885;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/nuttx/boards/Kconfig#L4077-L4120\u001b\\\u001b[4;34;4mn\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mu\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mt\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mt\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mx\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4m/\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mb\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mo\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ma\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mr\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4md\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ms\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4m/\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mK\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mc\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mo\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mn\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mf\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mi\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mg\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4m:\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4m4\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4m0\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4m7\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4m7\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4m-\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4m4\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4m1\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4m2\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4m0\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u001b\\,\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[J\u001b[6C\u001b[94mCONFIG_ARCH_BOARD_CUSTOM=y\u001b[m does not select \u001b[94mARCH_HAVE_LEDS\u001b[m unless \u001b[94mCONFIG_BOARD_CUSTOM_LEDS=y\u001b[m is enabled, and\r\n\u001b[6Cneither \u001b[94mCONFIG_USERLED\u001b[m nor \u001b[94mCONFIG_DEV_GPIO\u001b[m is enabled in \u001b[94mdefconfig\u001b[m. Nothing in the kernel or\n\u001b[92D\u001b[94mboards/arm/rp23xx/common\u001b[m calls \u001b[94mboard_autoled_*\u001b[m, \u001b[94mboard_userled_*\u001b["]
[0.000, "o", "m, or \u001b[94mrp23xx_dev_gpio_init()\u001b[m when those options\r\n\u001b[6Care off (and \u001b[94mrp23xx_boardearlyinitialize()\u001b[m in \u001b[94mrp23xx_boardinitialize.c\u001b[m already initializes the onboard \u001b[94mGPIO25\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6CLED directly). Furthermore, \u001b[94mrp23xx_gpio.c\u001b[m from \u001b[94mxiao-rp2350\u001b[m hardcodes \u001b[94mGPIO26..28\u001b[m (\u001b[94mD0..D2\u001b[m), colliding with \u001b[94mADC0\u001b[m,\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mLED1\u001b[m, and \u001b[94mLED2\u001b[m.\n\u001b[15D2. \u001b[1mPWM Shutdown (\u001b[94;22mpwm_stop()\u001b[39;1m vs. \u001b[94;22mpwm_shutdown()\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m: In \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk1d9da3b9f42709f6;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/nuttx/arch/arm/src/rp23xx/rp23xx_pwm.c#L643-L650\u0007nuttx/arch/arm/src/rp23xx/rp23xx_pwm.c:643-650\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[94mpwm_stop()\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C(\u001b[94mPWMIOC_STOP\u001b[m) only clears \u001b[94m1 << priv->num\u001b[m in \u001b[94mRP23XX_PWM_EN\u001b[m (leaving the pad frozen while the descriptor remains\r\n\u001b[6Copen), whereas \u001b[94mclose(fd)\u001b[m invokes \u001b[94mpwm_shutdown()\u001b[m (\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk35ec8adf6b713658;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/nuttx/arch/arm/src/rp23xx/rp23xx_pwm."]
[0.000, "o", "c#L249-L318\u0007nuttx/arch/arm/src/rp23xx/rp23xx_pwm.c:249-318\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007), which calls\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mpwm_stop()\u001b[m, configures \u001b[94mpin[0]\u001b[m and \u001b[94mpin[1]\u001b[m as outputs driven low (\u001b[94m0\u001b[m), switches their mux to \u001b[94mRP23XX_GPIO_FUNC_SIO\u001b[m,\r\n\u001b[6Cand zeros \u001b[94mpriv->duty[]\u001b[m.\r\n  • \u001b[1mAI Suggestion:\u001b[m \u001b[94mPROPOSE FIX\u001b[m\r\n  • \u001b[1mExplanation & Justification:\u001b[m Omitting \u001b[94mrp23xx_autoleds.c\u001b[m, \u001b[94mrp23xx_userleds.c\u001b[m, and \u001b[94mrp23xx_gpio.c\u001b[m from \u001b[94mxiao-rp2350-\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94mbargraph/board/src/\u001b[m (\u001b[94mCSRCS = rp23xx_boardinitialize.c rp23xx_bringup.c\u001b[m) eliminates ~750 lines of dead code and\r\n  removes the latent \u001b[94mGPIO26..28\u001b[m pin-mux collision. In \u001b[94mbargraph_shutdown_pwm()\u001b[m, zeroing the duties, issuing\r\n  \u001b[94mPWMIOC_STOP\u001b[m (which resets \u001b[94mupper->started = false\u001b[m in \u001b[94mdrivers/timers/pwm.c:428\u001b[m), and calling \u001b[94mclose(fd)\u001b[m (which invokes\r\n  \u001b[94mpwm_shutdown()\u001b[m to drive the pins low via \u001b[94mRP23XX_GPIO_FUNC_SIO\u001b[m) guarantees every LED turns off cleanly without\r\n  need"]
[0.000, "o", "ing an artificial \u001b[94musleep(2000)\u001b[m delay.\r\n  • \u001b[1mProposed Edit:\u001b[m\n\u001b[12D• Location: \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkd5ae067f5c14b8a2;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/docs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md#L23\u0007Line 23\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk276ed51b3a60e294;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/docs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md#L108-L110\u0007Lines 108–110\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkd640effa295798f0;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/docs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md#L279-L280\u0007Lines 279–280\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk7c812d3ce254fdf9;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/docs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md#L511-L520\u0007Lines 511–520\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkbf571198527aeda4;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/docs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md#L545-L565\u0007Lines 545–565\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk740ba8469ae2c52e;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/docs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md#L658-L659\u0007Lines 658–659\u001b[m\u001b]8;"]
[0.000, "o", ";\u0007\n\u001b[94D• Change:\n\u001b[5D• Remove \u001b[94mrp23xx_autoleds.c\u001b[m, \u001b[94mrp23xx_userleds.c\u001b[m, and \u001b[94mrp23xx_gpio.c\u001b[m from the directory tree (lines 108–110),\r\n\t  \u001b[94mboard/src/Make.defs\u001b[m (\u001b[94mCSRCS = rp23xx_boardinitialize.c rp23xx_bringup.c\u001b[m), and the Target Files list (former\r\n\t  items #18, #19, #20).\r\n\t  • Update Problem #5 (line 23), Section 4.2.4 (lines 279–280), and \u001b[94mbargraph_shutdown_pwm()\u001b[m (line 659) to\r\n\t  state that \u001b[94mpwm_stop()\u001b[m (\u001b[94mPWMIOC_STOP\u001b[m) only clears \u001b[94mRP23XX_PWM_EN\u001b[m while \u001b[94mclose(fd)\u001b[m invokes \u001b[94mpwm_shutdown()\u001b[m to\r\n\t  switch the pins to \u001b[94mRP23XX_GPIO_FUNC_SIO\u001b[m driven low (\u001b[94m0\u001b[m), so \u001b[94mbargraph_shutdown_pwm()\u001b[m writes zero duties,\r\n\t  calls \u001b[94mPWMI\u001b[m\r\n\n\n⢿  \u001b[90mLo\u001b[94mading\u001b[90m...\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m└ Tip: Use /skills to browse and manage agent skills.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────"]
[0.000, "o", "───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[94m>\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90mesc to cancel\u001b[m\u001b[77X\u001b[77C\u001b[33mauto\u001b[39;2m · Gemini 4 Argon · medium\u001b[m\r\u001b[2A\u001b[2C\u001b[?2026l"]
