[0.000, "o", "figs/bargraph/defconfig\u001b[m, lines\r\n\u001b[6C449–466) says \"Base on \u001b[94mxiao-rp2350/configs/usbnsh/defconfig\u001b[m\" without explicitly stating that\u001b[K\n\u001b[92D\u001b[94mCONFIG_ARCH_BOARD=\"xiao-rp2350\"\u001b[m and \u001b[94mCONFIG_ARCH_BOARD_XIAO_RP2350=y\u001b[m must be removed (because\n\u001b[92D\u001b[94mARCH_BOARD_XIAO_RP2350\u001b[m conflicts with \u001b[94mARCH_BOARD_CUSTOM\u001b[m in \u001b[94mnuttx/boards/Kconfig\u001b[m). In addition, \u001b[94mbargraphd\u001b[m holds\r\n\u001b[6C9 open file descriptors (\u001b[94m0, 1, 2\u001b[m + \u001b[94m/dev/adc0\u001b[m + 5 \u001b[94m/dev/pwm*\u001b[m), so \u001b[94mCONFIG_NFILE_DESCRIPTORS_PER_BLOCK\u001b[m should be\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[6Craised from \u001b[94m6\u001b[m to \u001b[94m12\u001b[m, and \u001b[94mCONFIG_RAW_BINARY=y\u001b[m and \u001b[94mCONFIG_RP23XX_UF2_BINARY=y\u001b[m should be listed explicitly.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[6C2. \u001b[94mboard/Kconfig\u001b[39;1m Symbol Alignment\u001b[m: Target File #3 (\u001b[94mboard/README.md\u001b[m, line 426) references \u001b[94mKconfig\u001b[m symbol\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mARCH_BOARD_XIAO_RP2350_BARGRAPH\u001b[m, whereas Target File #4 (\u001b[94mboard/Kconfig\u001b[m, line 433) hedges with \u001b[94mDefine if\u001b[m\n\u001b[92D\u001b[94mCUSTOM block (or empty Kconfig guard)"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[m.\u001b[K\n\u001b[49D3. \u001b[94mboard.h\u001b[39;1m Missing Sibling Includes\u001b[m: Upstream \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk23efc8b383ce7a4c;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/nuttx/boards/arm/rp23xx/xiao-rp2350/include/board.h#L30-L33\u0007nuttx/boards/arm/rp23xx/xiao-rp2350/include/board.h:30-33\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\n\u001b[6Cincludes \u001b[94m\"rp23xx_i2cdev.h\"\u001b[m, \u001b[94m\"rp23xx_spidev.h\"\u001b[m, \u001b[94m\"rp23xx_i2sdev.h\"\u001b[m, and \u001b[94m\"rp23xx_spisd.h\"\u001b[m, which do not exist in\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mxiao-rp2350-bargraph/board/include/\u001b[m. Target File #9 must state that those four \u001b[94m#include\u001b[m directives are omitted.\r\n\u001b[6C4. \u001b[94mrp23xx_bringup.c\u001b[39;1m Missing Register Headers\u001b[m: Upstream \u001b[94mxiao-rp2350/src/rp23xx_bringup.c\u001b[m does not include\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94m\"arm_internal.h\"\u001b[m or \u001b[94m\"hardware/rp23xx_pads_bank0.h\"\u001b[m. Target File #17 must explicitly list both \u001b[94m#include\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[6Cdirectives so \u001b[94mmodreg32\u001b[m and \u001b[94mRP23XX_PADS_BANK0_GPIO(26)\u001b[m compile without errors.\u001b[K\n\u001b[77D5. \u001b[1mBuild Artifact Name & \u001b[94;22mpicotool\u001b[39;1m Prerequisite\u001b[m: Line 679 r"]
[0.000, "o", "efers to \u001b[94mnuttx/nuttx.elf\u001b[m instead of \u001b[94mnuttx/nuttx\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C(\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkcaaa43699b25b337;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/nuttx/tools/rp23xx/Config.mk#L36\u0007nuttx/tools/rp23xx/Config.mk:36\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007) and uses a parenthetical caveat \u001b[94m(when picotool or UF2 conversion is enabled)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6Cinstead of stating the host prerequisite (\u001b[94mpicotool\u001b[m in \u001b[94mPATH\u001b[m or \u001b[94mPICO_SDK_PATH\u001b[m set).\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mAI Suggestion:\u001b[m \u001b[94mPROPOSE FIX\u001b[m\u001b[K\n\u001b[26D\u001b[1mExplanation & Justification:\u001b[m Specifying these exact Kconfig symbols, \u001b[94m#include\u001b[m rules, and build artifact names\r\n  removes all build and configuration guesswork in \u001b[94mDetailedRange\u001b[m.\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mProposed Edit:\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n      • Location: \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk9b631008f7d8e54c;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/docs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md#L426-L434\u0007Lines 426–434\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkb426562fc77b7231;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/docs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md#L4"]
