[0.184, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[33A\b\b\u001b[94mxiao-rp2350-bargraph/board/include/\u001b[m. Target File #9 must state that those four \u001b[94m#include\u001b[m directives are omitted.\r\n\u001b[6C4. \u001b[94mrp23xx_bringup.c\u001b[39;1m Missing Register Headers\u001b[m: Upstream \u001b[94mxiao-rp2350/src/rp23xx_bringup.c\u001b[m does not include\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94m\"arm_internal.h\"\u001b[m or \u001b[94m\"hardware/rp23xx_pads_bank0.h\"\u001b[m. Target File #17 must explicitly list both \u001b[94m#include\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[6Cdirectives so \u001b[94mmodreg32\u001b[m and \u001b[94mRP23XX_PADS_BANK0_GPIO(26)\u001b[m compile without errors.\u001b[K\n\u001b[77D5. \u001b[1mBuild Artifact Name & \u001b[94;22mpicotool\u001b[39;1m Prerequisite\u001b[m: Line 679 refers to \u001b[94mnuttx/nuttx.elf\u001b[m instead of \u001b[94mnuttx/nuttx\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C(\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk49c7365d3eb304a6;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/nuttx/tools/rp23xx/Config.mk#L36\u0007nuttx/tools/rp23xx/Config.mk:36\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007) and uses a parenthetical caveat \u001b[94m(when picotool or UF2 conversion is enabled)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6Cinstead of stating the host prerequisite (\u001b[94mpicotool\u001b[m in \u001b[94mPATH\u001b[m or \u001b[94mPICO_SDK_PATH\u001b[m set).\r"]
[0.000, "o", "\n  • \u001b[1mAI Suggestion:\u001b[m \u001b[94mPROPOSE FIX\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mExplanation & Justification:\u001b[m Specifying these exact Kconfig symbols, \u001b[94m#include\u001b[m rules, and build artifact names\u001b[K\r\n  removes all build and configuration guesswork in \u001b[94mDetailedRange\u001b[m.\u001b[K\n\u001b[61D\u001b[1mProposed Edit:\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n      • Location: \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk2860a1a707768639;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/docs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md#L426-L434\u0007Lines 426–434\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk43a2372b4ffe50a8;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/docs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md#L449-L466\u0007Lines 449–466\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkdfc89551ee860276;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/docs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md#L474-L482\u0007Lines 474–482\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkccb714d81196224e;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/docs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md#L535-L544\u0007Lines 535–544\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk3f7fd356d16d1164;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxs"]
