[0.000, "o", "ph_main.c\u001b[m)\r\n  • \u001b[1mDescription:\u001b[m\n\u001b[10D1. \u001b[94mMAINSRC\u001b[39;1m \u001b[94;22m-Dmain=bargraph_main\u001b[39;1m Rule\u001b[m: \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jke53411292943c47c;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/apps/Application.mk#L353-L357\u0007apps/Application.mk:353-357\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 compiles \u001b[94mMAINSRC = bargraph_main.c\u001b[m with \u001b[94m-\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mDmain=$(PROGSYM)_main\u001b[m (\u001b[94m-Dmain=bargraph_main\u001b[m). Target File #30 should explicitly specify defining \u001b[94mint main(int\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94margc, FAR char *argv[])\u001b[m in \u001b[94mbargraph_main.c\u001b[m (rewritten to \u001b[94mbargraph_main\u001b[m by the preprocessor).\n\u001b[92D2. \u001b[1mHedged Modifiers & Wait Mechanism\u001b[m: Line 526 hedges \u001b[94m\"weak/conditional\"\u001b[m, line 657 hedges \u001b[94m(when not yet started\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mor on update)\u001b[m for \u001b[94mPWMIOC_START\u001b[m, and line 664 hedges \u001b[94mpthread_cond_timedwait() (CLOCK_REALTIME or usleep + mutex\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mlock)\u001b[m.\n\u001b[6D3. \u001b[1mMissing Initialization & Telemetry Specifications\u001b[m: Target File #30 omits \u001b[94mPTHREAD_MUTEX_INITIALIZER\u001b[m /\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mPTHREA"]
[0.000, "o", "D_COND_INITIALIZER\u001b[m initialization of \u001b[94mg_bargraph\u001b[m, startup failure cleanup in \u001b[94mbargraphd_daemon()\u001b[m (closing\r\n\u001b[6Copened fds, setting \u001b[94minit_err\u001b[m, broadcasting \u001b[94mdone_cond\u001b[m), exact integer formulas for \u001b[94mmillivolts\u001b[m, \u001b[94mpermille\u001b[m, and\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mtotal_units\u001b[m across \u001b[94mSENSING\u001b[m/\u001b[94mMANUAL\u001b[m/\u001b[94mTEST\u001b[m modes, and the exact \u001b[94mprintf\u001b[m format layout for \u001b[94mbargraph status\u001b[m.\r\n\u001b[6C4. \u001b[1mAltitude Duplication\u001b[m: \u001b[94mFeatureRange\u001b[m Section 5 (lines 303–332) embeds the full low-level C declaration of \u001b[94menum\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mbargraph_mode_e\u001b[m and \u001b[94mstruct bargraph_state_s\u001b[m, which duplicates \u001b[94mDetailedRange\u001b[m Target File #29 (\u001b[94mbargraph_internal.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mh\u001b[m).\r\n  • \u001b[1mAI Suggestion:\u001b[m \u001b[94mPROPOSE FIX\u001b[m\r\n  • \u001b[1mExplanation & Justification:\u001b[m Summarizing \u001b[94mstruct bargraph_state_s\u001b[m as a field-level table in \u001b[94mFeatureRange\u001b[m Section 5\r\n  while placing the full C struct definition in \u001b[94mDetailedRange\u001b[m Target File #29 maintains the"]
