[0.066, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[30AHow would you like to proceed with \u001b[1mItem 9\u001b[m? Please reply with \u001b[1mAccept proposed fix\u001b[m, \u001b[1mSkip / ignore\u001b[m, or \u001b[1mDiscuss\u001b[m.\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m> accept\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[37m▸ Thought for 10s\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u001b[1m### Breakdown Item 10 (of 12): Fix Misleading \u001b[94m+3.3V Rail\u001b[39m Line Into \u001b[94mRow 7\u001b[39m (\u001b[94mD2/A2\u001b[39m) in Breadboard ASCII Diagram [\u001b[94megm-\u001b[39m \u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94;1mcomprehension\u001b[39m]\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  • \u001b[1mScope:\u001b[m \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkc92e74dbbca03c50;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/docs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md#L171-L185\u0007Lines 171–185\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 (\u001b[94m#### 400-Tie-Point Breadboard Layout\u001b[m)\n\u001b[59D\u001b[1mDescription:\u001b[m In the \u001b[94m400-Tie-Point Breadboard Layout\u001b[m ASCII diagram, the vertical line descending from \u001b[94m+3.3V Rail\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94m(Red +)\u001b[m on the left side connects via "]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[94m+---\u001b[m into \u001b[94mRow 7: +---[D2/A2 GPIO28 (7E)]\u001b[m, even though \u001b[94m3V3\u001b[m is on the right\u001b[K\r\n  side of Row 7 (\u001b[94m[(7F) 3V3]\u001b[m, jumpered from \u001b[94m7J\u001b[m to the Red \u001b[94m+\u001b[m 3.3V rail).\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mAI Suggestion:\u001b[m \u001b[94mPROPOSE FIX\u001b[m\u001b[K\n\u001b[26D\u001b[1mExplanation & Justification:\u001b[m Ending the left-hand \u001b[94m+3.3V Rail\u001b[m line at \u001b[94mRow 1: +---[ Potentiometer Lug 1 (CW / 3.3V)\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94m]\u001b[m and showing \u001b[94mRow 7\u001b[m's \u001b[94m3V3\u001b[m jumper strictly on the right side (\u001b[94m7F\u001b[m / \u001b[94m7J\u001b[m -> Red \u001b[94m+\u001b[m 3.3V rail) eliminates any visual\u001b[K\r\n  ambiguity that could lead someone to wire the \u001b[94m3.3V\u001b[m rail to \u001b[94mD2\u001b[m (\u001b[94mGPIO28\u001b[m).\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mProposed Edit:\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n      • Location: \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk75196a0798ad9208;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/docs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md#L174-L181\u0007Lines 174–181\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\n\tChange: Replace lines 174–181 with:\n\u001b[37D  \u001b[38;5;252m  Row 1: +---[ Potentiometer Lug 1 (CW / 3.3V) ]    |\u001b[m\n\u001b[47D\u001b[38;5;252m2: \u001b[4b[ Potentiometer"]
