[0.016, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[31AHow would you like to proceed with \u001b[1mItem 10\u001b[m? Please reply with \u001b[1mAccept proposed fix\u001b[m, \u001b[1mSkip / ignore\u001b[m, or \u001b[1mDiscuss\u001b[m.\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m> accept\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[37m▸ Thought for 11s\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u001b[1m### Breakdown Item 11 (of 12): Add \u001b[94mTEST --> STOPPED\u001b[39m Transition in State Machine Diagram and Preempt \u001b[94mTEST\u001b[39m Sweep on  \u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94;1mstop_requested\u001b[39m [\u001b[94megm-design\u001b[39m / \u001b[94megm-inventive-catalyst\u001b[39m]\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  • \u001b[1mScope:\u001b[m \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jke6b27cba29a06fc0;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/docs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md#L288-L301\u0007Lines 288–301\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkf2514fa02c473c8e;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/docs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md#L343\u0007Line 343\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 (\u001b[94m### 5. Daemon State Machine & IPC Synchroniza"]
[0.000, "o", "tion\u001b[m)\n\u001b[82D\u001b[1mDescription:\u001b[m The Mermaid state diagram includes \u001b[94mSENSING --> STOPPED\u001b[m and \u001b[94mMANUAL --> STOPPED\u001b[m, but omits \u001b[94mTEST -->\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94mSTOPPED\u001b[m if \u001b[94mbargraph stop\u001b[m is executed while a 2.0-second \u001b[94mbargraph test\u001b[m sweep is running (e.g., if \u001b[94mbargraph test &\u001b[m\r\n  was backgrounded in NSH).\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mAI Suggestion:\u001b[m \u001b[94mPROPOSE FIX\u001b[m\n\u001b[26D\u001b[1mExplanation & Justification:\u001b[m Adding \u001b[94mTEST --> STOPPED : \"bargraph stop\"\u001b[m to the Mermaid state diagram, auto-\r\n  starting \u001b[94mbargraphd\u001b[m if \u001b[94mbargraph test\u001b[m is invoked while \u001b[94mSTOPPED\u001b[m (consistent with \u001b[94mbargraph set\u001b[m), and checking\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[94mstop_requested\u001b[m at each 20 ms step of the 100-step sweep guarantees \u001b[94mbargraph stop\u001b[m preempts an active sweep within a\r\n  single 20 ms frame and broadcasts \u001b[94mdone_cond\u001b[m without blocking for 2 seconds.\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mProposed Edit:\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n      • Location: \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkde1f3db6518c11f8;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/docs/d"]
[0.000, "o", "esigns/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md#L299-L301\u0007Lines 299–301\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 and \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkf25151a02c473ff4;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/docs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md#L343\u0007Line 343\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\n\tChange:\u001b[K\n\u001b[9D    • Add \u001b[94mTEST --> STOPPED : \"bargraph stop\" (abort sweep -> zero duty -> PWMIOC_STOP -> close)\u001b[m to the Mermaid\r\n\t  \u001b[94mstateDiagram-v2\u001b[m.\u001b[K\r\n\t  • On line 343 (\u001b[94mbargraph test\u001b[m), state that if \u001b[94mbargraphd\u001b[m is \u001b[94mSTOPPED\u001b[m, \u001b[94mbargraph test\u001b[m starts it first, and that\r\n\t  each 20 ms step of the 100-step sweep checks \u001b[94mstop_requested\u001b[m so \u001b[94mbargraph stop\u001b[m aborts the sweep immediately\u001b[K\r\n\t  and wakes any\u001b[K\n\n\n\n\n\u001b[21D\u001b[?2026l"]
