[0.000, "o", " 351 (\"channel indexing quirks\"), and 371 (\"while remaining\r\n\u001b[6Cforgiving\").\r\n  • \u001b[1mAI Suggestion:\u001b[m \u001b[94mPROPOSE FIX\u001b[m\r\n  • \u001b[1mExplanation & Justification:\u001b[m Converting the repository file paths in \u001b[94mAdditional Resources\u001b[m into clickable relative\r\n  Markdown links (\u001b[94m[nuttx/...](../../nuttx/...)\u001b[m), promoting \u001b[94m## Additional Resources\u001b[m and \u001b[94m## Future Improvements\u001b[m to H2,\r\n  standardizing horizontal rules on \u001b[94m---\u001b[m, and replacing the six colloquial/repetitive phrases with objective technical\r\n  wording brings the document into full compliance with structural and style standards.\r\n  • \u001b[1mProposed Edit:\u001b[m\n\u001b[12D• Location: \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk8d740e2cccda1675;file:///Users/brett/Documents/GitHub/nuttxspace-egm/docs/designs/xiao-rp2350-bargraph.md#L7-L401\u0007Lines 7–401\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\n\u001b[23D• Change:\n\u001b[5D• Convert the 4 file paths in \u001b[94mAdditional Resources\u001b[m to clickable relative links (\u001b[94m[nuttx/...](../../nuttx/...\u001b[m\r\n\t  \u001b[94m)\u001b[m and \u001b[94m[apps/...](../../apps/...)\u001b[m).\r"]
[0.000, "o", "\n\t  • Promote \u001b[94m## Additional Resources\u001b[m and \u001b[94m## Future Improvements\u001b[m to H2 and standardize horizontal rules on \u001b[94m---\u001b[m.\r\n\t  • Replace \"completely clean\" -> \"produce empty output\" (line 30), remove duplicate \"cleanly\" (line 70),\r\n\t  replace \"wipe out\" -> \"overwrite\" (line 237), replace \"complete darkness\" -> \"zero duty\" (line 255),\r\n\t  replace \"channel indexing quirks\" -> \"channel-array indexing mismatch\" (line 351), and replace \"while\r\n\t  remaining forgiving\" -> \"while accepting \u001b[94mbargraph start\u001b[m as a synonym\" (line 371).\r\n\n\n\n  How would you like to proceed with \u001b[1mItem 12\u001b[m? Please reply with \u001b[1mAccept proposed fix\u001b[m, \u001b[1mSkip / ignore\u001b[m, or \u001b[1mDiscuss\u001b[m.\r\n\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m> accept\u001b[m\r\n⣯  \u001b[94mLoad\u001b[90ming...\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m──────────────────────────"]
